ned amount of time starting from the moment"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the shared offline storage object is initialized until the packs are fetched"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"from the database. After that point, this property is always non-nil, but it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"may be empty to indicate that no packs are present."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To detect when the shared offline storage object has finished loading its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"packs","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" property, observe KVO change notifications on the "},{"code":"packs","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" key path."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The initial load results in an "},{"code":"NSKeyValueChangeSetting","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" change."}]}]}],"references":{"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre":{"url":"\/documentation\/maplibre","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Powerful, free and open-source mapping toolkit with full control over data sources and styling."}],"role":"collection","title":"MapLibre","type":"topic"},"doc://org.swift.MyProject/documentation/MapLibre/MLNOfflineStorage":{"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/org.swift.MyProject\/documentation\/MapLibre\/MLNOfflineStorage","abstract":[{"text":"MLNOfflineStorage implements a singleton (shared object) that manages offline","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"packs and ambient caching. All of this class’s instance methods are asynchronous,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"reflecting the fact that offline resources are stored in a database. The shared","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"object maintains a canonical collection of offline packs in its ","type":"text"},{"code":"packs","type